          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "planear is plan, \"a plan\", with -ear. Plan came from French plan, a drawing on a flat surface, from Latin planus, \"flat\"."
            }
          ]
        },
